# portfolio-web — core agent rules

Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root before non-trivial changes.

## Must run before finishing

- `npm run verify` (sync + lint + build — **mandatory**, see `.cursor/rules/automation.mdc`)

## Must follow

- JavaScript only; `@/` path alias.
- Content in `lib/site-content.js`, routes in `lib/site/constants.js`.
- Minimal diffs; no drive-by refactors or new abstractions for one-off use.
- No commits unless the user explicitly asks.
- Shell wraps all pages via `PortfolioShell` — do not bypass it in `layout.js`.

## Must avoid

- Secrets in repo; force-push; amending others' commits.
- Re-adding WebGL, boot, audio, or custom-cursor effects.
- Animation libraries in `ShellProvider` or route-enter horizontal slides.
- Heavy `backdrop-filter` on cards without perf justification.

## Performance

- Keep heavy visual dependencies out of the shell.
- After perf work: `npm run perf:full` and reference `perf-reports/latest.json`.
